                "message": "✨ Add sp-notes-trash to move a note to the system trash (C-; n d)\n\n- Moves the current note (C-u: a picked file) to the trash, kills the buffer\n- Confirms with title and path; warns and needs `yes` when other notes link to it\n- Forgets the file in the vulpea index and drops its ids from org-id-locations\n- Bound to `d` in the notes keymap; docs and 8 ERT tests included\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiAj4gwhPvJxPrg7LJv",
